  "description": "XrmToolBox plugin to manage Dataverse / Dynamics 365 metadata translations\n\t  (tables, forms, fields, choices, views, business process flows, ...) from a\n\t  single grid. Supports inline editing and a full Excel (.xlsx) export/import\n\t  round-trip with no third-party dependencies. Includes a built-in Help dialog\n\t  with step-by-step instructions for both the single-record and the bulk\n\t  translation workflows.",
